      "verification": "不再複製 worker index；從 HEAD baseline 建立 temp index，overlay 採工作樹內容並先分類 scope/exclude。Staged .env.fake 不從 index 帶入；staged out-of-scope 在 add/tree/commit/ref 前拒絕。Tracked excluded 的未修改保留與修改拒絕已明定，controller 匯入再查 tree 差異。原 untracked 遺失與 staged 排除繞過反例均已解除。",
      "basis": "reviewed-v3/design.md:214–247；tasks.md:32–43；validation.md:70–71、94",
